      <description><![CDATA[
        India’s defense tech leap: Sagar Defence UAS and C-DAC successfully test airborne quantum-secure communications using entanglement-based QKD and PQC at MCTE Mhow.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The demonstration integrated device-independent Quantum Key Distribution and Post-Quantum Cryptography for multi-layered security.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Led by C-DAC at MCTE Mhow, the trial marks a critical milestone for India&#39;s Drone-QC initiative aimed at battlefield resilience.
